    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104483" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρᾰγ-ίσκος</span></b> , ὁ, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τράγος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>young he-goat,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				5.141
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.317
			</span></i>: also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρᾰγ-ίσκιον</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξάγω κῶλον τραγίσκιον</span>
			 (a game played at Tarentum). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>ornament in form of a goat, Inscr. Délos</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				461
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Bb</u>
				19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>a sea-fish,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Marc.Sid.
				23
			</span></i>.</div>
